  m_Name: AHorseOfYourOwn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestDefinition
  id: ahorseofyourown
  displayName: A Horse of Your Own
  description: The old places lie far out past the meadows, a long walk on foot, and a loaded cart drags at your arms. A wild horse grazes near the Haven. Make a Lasso by hand (4 Nettle Cord, 1 Rough Hide) and bring 4 Barley (grown on a Farm Plot, or found in caches and barrels in the woods). Get close without it bolting, rope it, hold on through the struggle, ride it until it gives in, and feed it barley.
  chain: 
  journalNotes: 'Wild horses are shy: come at them low and slow. A lasso holds one long enough to climb on; barley, fed a few times, makes it yours. A Stable keeps it, and two in one can foal.'
